{"4522300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lil Planet Explorer", "steam_appid": 4522300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little astronaut. A big universe. A story worth discovering.                                                                                                                                                         </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Lil Planet Explorer is a cozy idle game that lives right on your desktop. A small astronaut travels from planet to planet — collecting resources, meeting strange creatures, and slowly uncovering a mystery written between the   stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >84 Planets. No Two Alike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Alien jungles, frozen wastelands, glowing crystal fields, rolling dunes. Every planet is procedurally generated with its own terrain, colors, and atmosphere. Land. Explore. Collect. Move on.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/33719f772bdef55d09f5ee5254ad48ea.poster.avif?t=1776273427\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/33719f772bdef55d09f5ee5254ad48ea.webm?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/33719f772bdef55d09f5ee5254ad48ea.mp4?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Quiet Desktop Companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A transparent little window you can tuck into any corner of your screen. It's there when you want it, quiet when you don't. Resize it, drag it around, or just let it sit while you work. Your astronaut doesn't mind.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/2238b1ead8382c4f7bd4a4bc5d2ac148.poster.avif?t=1776273427\" width=516 height=522 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/2238b1ead8382c4f7bd4a4bc5d2ac148.webm?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/2238b1ead8382c4f7bd4a4bc5d2ac148.mp4?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Friends Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  12 alien species are scattered across the universe. Wave at them enough and they just might follow you home. Across the stars, even.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/dd7a5e5217b26d21d72dd72a2d5e0f9f.poster.avif?t=1776273427\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/dd7a5e5217b26d21d72dd72a2d5e0f9f.webm?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/dd7a5e5217b26d21d72dd72a2d5e0f9f.mp4?t=1776273427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story Hidden in the Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Logbook entries unfold planet by planet. At first, everything seems fine. Then the questions start. Who built you? Why can't you remember? And why does the journey feel like it's counting down?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522300/extras/51c14ec73db259245654e3c32bc379db.avif?t=1776273427\" width=780 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p 